'''NOTE:''' It is highly recommended to ensure you don't have any '''uncollected''' '''[[Gold bar|gold bars]]''' in the [[bar dispenser]] when smelting additional [[gold ore]], otherwise only a small portion of the experience is awarded when the ore finishes smelting; the remainder is granted upon collecting the bars, making it a lot more click-intensive to maintain high xp rates with the [[goldsmith gauntlets]]. 

''To maintain maximum efficiency with extra bars in the dispenser, you need to have goldsmith gauntlets equipped for the initial partial XP drop, equip your ice gloves and click the bar dispenser to open the collection dialogue, then go back to hover over the goldsmith gauntlets, and confirm the dialogue (by pressing 1 or Space). Then re-equip the gauntlets '''before the next game tick''', when the remaining experience is applied.''

